{"id":"706acac2c3076a7b","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-ramified-truth.md","title":"原书的迭代组合真理 RT","display":"df-ramified-truth — 原书的迭代组合真理 RT","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-ramified-truth","aliases":["91-df-ramified-truth"],"display":"df-ramified-truth — 原书的迭代组合真理 RT","depends_on":["[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","[[91-df-induction-schema]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-ramified-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-ramified-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ramified-truth — 原书的迭代组合真理 RT"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"09791de618b277ba\" href=\"?note=09791de618b277ba\" title=\"91-df-induction-schema\">91-df-induction-schema</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 为基础算术；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_{&lt;\\gamma}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_{&lt;\\gamma}}\\)</span> 为全层级语言归纳模式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span> 为经典一阶闭包。</li>\n<li>固定原书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_0\">\\(\\Gamma_0\\)</span> 以下的原始递归序数记法及关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\">\\(\\prec\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\le\\Gamma_0\">\\(\\gamma\\le\\Gamma_0\\)</span> 是元层给定的界。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{&lt;\\beta}=\\mathcal L_0\\cup\\{T_\\alpha:\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{&lt;\\beta}=\\mathcal L_0\\cup\\{T_\\alpha:\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\}\\)</span>，各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\alpha\">\\(T_\\alpha\\)</span> 是不同的一元谓词符号。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{code}(\\beta)\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(\\operatorname{code}(\\beta)\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是固定记法中表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta&lt;\\Gamma_0\">\\(\\beta&lt;\\Gamma_0\\)</span> 的唯一序数项编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\">\\(\\prec\\)</span> 比较这些编码所表示的序数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{&lt;\\beta}(a)\">\\(D_{&lt;\\beta}(a)\\)</span> 统一表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 层以下的句子编码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tr}_{\\delta}(t)\">\\(\\operatorname{tr}_{\\delta}(t)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\delta\">\\(T_\\delta\\)</span> 作用于编码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 的项的公式编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span> 在该编码函数及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{&lt;\\delta}\">\\(D_{&lt;\\delta}\\)</span> 中是对象数变量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall s,\\forall t\">\\(\\forall s,\\forall t\\)</span> 遍历闭项编码；其余句法运算复用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a> 的自然扩展。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\gamma},\\mathrm{RT}_\\beta\">\\(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\gamma},\\mathrm{RT}_\\beta\\)</span> 是下述理论。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\beta}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\beta}\\)</span> 包含下列对象句（第七条对每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha&lt;\\beta\">\\(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\)</span> 列实例）：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ramified\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall s\\forall t\\,(T_\\beta(\\operatorname{eq}(s,t))\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(s)=\\operatorname{val}(t));\\\\\n&amp;\\forall a\\,[D_{&lt;\\beta}(a)\\to(T_\\beta(\\operatorname{neg}(a))\\leftrightarrow\\neg T_\\beta(a))];\\\\\n&amp;\\forall a\\forall b\\,[D_{&lt;\\beta}(\\operatorname{conj}(a,b))\\to(T_\\beta(\\operatorname{conj}(a,b))\\leftrightarrow(T_\\beta(a)\\land T_\\beta(b)))];\\\\\n&amp;\\forall a\\forall b\\,[D_{&lt;\\beta}(\\operatorname{disj}(a,b))\\to(T_\\beta(\\operatorname{disj}(a,b))\\leftrightarrow(T_\\beta(a)\\lor T_\\beta(b)))];\\\\\n&amp;\\forall v\\forall a\\,[D_{&lt;\\beta}(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))\\to(T_\\beta(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))\\leftrightarrow\\forall t\\,T_\\beta(\\operatorname{SubTm}(a,t,v)))];\\\\\n&amp;\\forall v\\forall a\\,[D_{&lt;\\beta}(\\operatorname{ex}(v,a))\\to(T_\\beta(\\operatorname{ex}(v,a))\\leftrightarrow\\exists t\\,T_\\beta(\\operatorname{SubTm}(a,t,v)))];\\\\\n&amp;\\forall t\\,[D_{&lt;\\alpha}(\\operatorname{val}(t))\\to(T_\\beta(\\operatorname{tr}_{\\alpha}(t))\\leftrightarrow T_\\alpha(\\operatorname{val}(t)))];\\\\\n&amp;\\forall t\\forall\\delta\\,[\\delta\\prec\\overline{\\operatorname{code}(\\beta)}\\land D_{&lt;\\delta}(\\operatorname{val}(t))\\to\n(T_\\beta(\\operatorname{tr}_{\\delta}(t))\\leftrightarrow T_\\beta(\\operatorname{val}(t)))].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ramified\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall s\\forall t\\,(T_\\beta(\\operatorname{eq}(s,t))\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(s)=\\operatorname{val}(t));\\\\\n&amp;\\forall a\\,[D_{&lt;\\beta}(a)\\to(T_\\beta(\\operatorname{neg}(a))\\leftrightarrow\\neg T_\\beta(a))];\\\\\n&amp;\\forall a\\forall b\\,[D_{&lt;\\beta}(\\operatorname{conj}(a,b))\\to(T_\\beta(\\operatorname{conj}(a,b))\\leftrightarrow(T_\\beta(a)\\land T_\\beta(b)))];\\\\\n&amp;\\forall a\\forall b\\,[D_{&lt;\\beta}(\\operatorname{disj}(a,b))\\to(T_\\beta(\\operatorname{disj}(a,b))\\leftrightarrow(T_\\beta(a)\\lor T_\\beta(b)))];\\\\\n&amp;\\forall v\\forall a\\,[D_{&lt;\\beta}(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))\\to(T_\\beta(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))\\leftrightarrow\\forall t\\,T_\\beta(\\operatorname{SubTm}(a,t,v)))];\\\\\n&amp;\\forall v\\forall a\\,[D_{&lt;\\beta}(\\operatorname{ex}(v,a))\\to(T_\\beta(\\operatorname{ex}(v,a))\\leftrightarrow\\exists t\\,T_\\beta(\\operatorname{SubTm}(a,t,v)))];\\\\\n&amp;\\forall t\\,[D_{&lt;\\alpha}(\\operatorname{val}(t))\\to(T_\\beta(\\operatorname{tr}_{\\alpha}(t))\\leftrightarrow T_\\alpha(\\operatorname{val}(t)))];\\\\\n&amp;\\forall t\\forall\\delta\\,[\\delta\\prec\\overline{\\operatorname{code}(\\beta)}\\land D_{&lt;\\delta}(\\operatorname{val}(t))\\to\n(T_\\beta(\\operatorname{tr}_{\\delta}(t))\\leftrightarrow T_\\beta(\\operatorname{val}(t)))].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\gamma}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\n\\left(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_{&lt;\\gamma}}\\cup\\bigcup_{\\beta&lt;\\gamma}\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\beta}\\right),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{RT}_\\beta\\coloneqq\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\beta+1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\gamma}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\n\\left(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_{&lt;\\gamma}}\\cup\\bigcup_{\\beta&lt;\\gamma}\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\beta}\\right),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{RT}_\\beta\\coloneqq\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\beta+1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这不是只迭代标准闭句 TB 的层级：每层使用统一编码组合公理，并保留第八条的累积性。第七条的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 只作谓词符号下标，不能以对象量词绑定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\alpha\">\\(T_\\alpha\\)</span>；第八条绑定的是造公式编码的数变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span>，没有变量谓词符号。\n真理原子子句只在其项值属于正确低层语言时作规定，不能删除这些语言守卫。归纳覆盖整个当前层语言。\n本节点补齐目录中先前广泛使用却没有定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_0\">\\(\\varepsilon_0\\)</span> 是层级长度，不是这些理论各自的证明论序数。</p>\n<p>本目录统一使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{&lt;\\beta}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{&lt;\\beta}\\)</span>；原书的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\beta\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\beta\\)</span> 对应这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{&lt;\\beta+1}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{&lt;\\beta+1}\\)</span>，不能把两个层号约定混用。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 9.1–9.2，印刷页 112–114，PDF 页 123–125。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-induction-schema","status":"resolved","id":"09791de618b277ba","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-induction-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\forall s,\\forall t$ 遍历闭项编码；其余句法运算复用 [[91-df-coded-syntax]] 的自然扩展。$\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\gamma},\\mathrm{RT}_\\beta$ 是下述理论。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_{<\\gamma}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma\\le\\Gamma_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{<\\beta}=\\mathcal L_0\\cup\\{T_\\alpha:\\alpha<\\beta\\}","display":false},{"tex":"T_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{code}(\\beta)\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta<\\Gamma_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec","display":false},{"tex":"D_{<\\beta}(a)","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tr}_{\\delta}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"T_\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"D_{<\\delta}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall s,\\forall t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\gamma},\\mathrm{RT}_\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\beta}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha<\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ramified\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\forall s\\forall t\\,(T_\\beta(\\operatorname{eq}(s,t))\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(s)=\\operatorname{val}(t));\\\\\n&\\forall a\\,[D_{<\\beta}(a)\\to(T_\\beta(\\operatorname{neg}(a))\\leftrightarrow\\neg T_\\beta(a))];\\\\\n&\\forall a\\forall b\\,[D_{<\\beta}(\\operatorname{conj}(a,b))\\to(T_\\beta(\\operatorname{conj}(a,b))\\leftrightarrow(T_\\beta(a)\\land T_\\beta(b)))];\\\\\n&\\forall a\\forall b\\,[D_{<\\beta}(\\operatorname{disj}(a,b))\\to(T_\\beta(\\operatorname{disj}(a,b))\\leftrightarrow(T_\\beta(a)\\lor T_\\beta(b)))];\\\\\n&\\forall v\\forall a\\,[D_{<\\beta}(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))\\to(T_\\beta(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))\\leftrightarrow\\forall t\\,T_\\beta(\\operatorname{SubTm}(a,t,v)))];\\\\\n&\\forall v\\forall a\\,[D_{<\\beta}(\\operatorname{ex}(v,a))\\to(T_\\beta(\\operatorname{ex}(v,a))\\leftrightarrow\\exists t\\,T_\\beta(\\operatorname{SubTm}(a,t,v)))];\\\\\n&\\forall t\\,[D_{<\\alpha}(\\operatorname{val}(t))\\to(T_\\beta(\\operatorname{tr}_{\\alpha}(t))\\leftrightarrow T_\\alpha(\\operatorname{val}(t)))];\\\\\n&\\forall t\\forall\\delta\\,[\\delta\\prec\\overline{\\operatorname{code}(\\beta)}\\land D_{<\\delta}(\\operatorname{val}(t))\\to\n(T_\\beta(\\operatorname{tr}_{\\delta}(t))\\leftrightarrow T_\\beta(\\operatorname{val}(t)))].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\gamma}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\n\\left(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_{<\\gamma}}\\cup\\bigcup_{\\beta<\\gamma}\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\beta}\\right),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{RT}_\\beta\\coloneqq\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\beta+1}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"T_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\varepsilon_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{<\\beta}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{<\\beta+1}","display":false}],"bytes":3891,"backlinks":[{"id":"8f93c57db760a2b7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定原书有效序数记法内的 $\\gamma\\le\\Gamma_0$，$I=\\{\\alpha:\\alpha<\\gamma\\}$；$\\mathcal L_{<\\alpha}$、$T_\\alpha$ 采用 [[91-df-ramified-truth]]。"},{"id":"6b23223b4dd97161","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e17f40587f032600","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FS}$ 为原书全归纳版本，$\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\omega}$ 使用 [[91-df-ramified-truth]] 的八子句与全层语言归纳。"},{"id":"c096df80861122dd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"正生成固定点存在且空种子闭包保持信息一致。固定点十三子句逐项验证 KF，信息一致性验证 CONS；标准数域上的任意谓词解释都满足完整对象归纳。由经典可靠性得无矛盾证明。\n这是在能进行该超限构造的元理论中的模型证明，不是 PA 内部证明 KF 一致性。旧断言以未验证的证明归约作前提，将书中的结果弱化成条件句；现给出明确模型。相对证明论强度另见 [[91-df-ramified-truth]] 及原书 §15.3。"},{"id":"d84df7f701355c56","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-69","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-ramified-truth]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-86","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-ramified-truth]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-76","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-language.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-model.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchical-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories.md]]\n[[91-df-implication-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-induction-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-inner-outer-logic-difference.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-induction.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-iterative-construction.md]]\n[[91-df-jump-operator.md]]\n[[91-df-language-with-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-